<% layout("layouts/boilerplate") %>

<body>
    <section class="contact">

        <div class="row">
           <div class="image">
              <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwzzzllfr/image/upload/v1732199554/contact-img_wa6ucm.svg" alt="#">
           </div>
           <form action="" method="post">
              <h3>Get in touch</h3>
              <input type="text" name="name" required maxlength="50" placeholder="Enter your name" class="box">
              <input type="email" name="email" required maxlength="50" placeholder="Enter your email" class="box">
              <input type="number" name="number" required maxlength="10" max="9999999999" min="0" placeholder="Enter your number" class="box">
              <textarea name="message" placeholder="Enter your message" required maxlength="1000" cols="30" rows="10" class="box"></textarea>
              <input type="submit" value="send message" name="send" class="btn">
           </form>
        </div>
     
     </section>
     
     <!-- contact section ends -->
     
     <!-- faq section starts  -->
     
     <section class="faq" id="faq">
     
        <h1 class="heading">FAQ</h1>
     
        <div class="box-container">
     
           <div class="box active">
              <h3><span>How to cancel booking?</span><i class="fas fa-angle-down"></i></h3>
              <p>To cancel a booking on Noble Nest, log in to your account and navigate to the "My Bookings" section. Select the booking you wish to cancel and click on “Cancel Booking.” Follow the on-screen instructions to confirm. For assistance, contact our support team for prompt and professional help.</p>
           </div>
     
           <div class="box active">
              <h3><span>When will I get the possession?</span><i class="fas fa-angle-down"></i></h3>
              <p>Possession timelines vary depending on the specific property and its construction status. For ready-to-move homes, possession is typically immediate upon completion of documentation and payments. For under-construction properties, possession dates are provided by the developer and outlined in your agreement. Please contact our team for project-specific timelines and updates</p>
           </div>
     
           <div class="box">
              <h3><span>Where can I pay the rent?</span><i class="fas fa-angle-down"></i></h3>
              <p>You can conveniently pay your rent through the Noble Nest platform using secure online payment options. Simply log in to your account, navigate to the "Payments" section, and choose your preferred method. We support credit/debit cards, net banking, and UPI to ensure a smooth, fast, and hassle-free transaction experience.</p>
           </div>
     
           <div class="box">
              <h3><span>How to contact with the buyers?</span><i class="fas fa-angle-down"></i></h3>
              <p>To contact buyers, use the provided inquiry form or contact details listed with each property. Ensure your message is clear, professional, and includes your interest and contact information. Prompt responses and polite communication help build trust and increase the chances of successful engagement with serious, interested buyers.</p>
           </div>
     
           <div class="box">
              <h3><span>Why my listing not showing up?</span><i class="fas fa-angle-down"></i></h3>
              <p>If your listing isn’t showing up, it may be due to pending admin approval, missing required details, or incomplete image uploads. Ensure all fields are correctly filled and the listing complies with platform guidelines. Also, check your internet connection or try refreshing the page after a few minutes for updates.</p>
           </div>
     
           <div class="box">
              <h3><span>How to promote my listing?</span><i class="fas fa-angle-down"></i></h3>
              <p>To promote your listing effectively, ensure high-quality photos, a compelling title, and a detailed, accurate description. Share the listing on social media platforms, real estate groups, and relevant forums.</p>
           </div>
     
        </div>
     
     </section>
</body>
